<section class="bhd-page__cards-section">
  <p class="bhd-page__kicker">RACE-WEEK BASICS</p>
  <h2>Keep the plan boring enough to execute</h2>
  <div class="bhd-page__cards bhd-page__cards--3">
    <article><h3>Before</h3><p>Arrive normally hydrated. Do not turn race morning into an experiment.</p></article>
    <article><h3>During</h3><p>Match fluid access to distance, heat, sweat and course support rather than forcing a fixed number.</p></article>
    <article><h3>After</h3><p>Replace meaningful fluid losses and eat normally. Recovery still includes food, rest and sleep.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

